Conflicts: bigcouch-unofficial
Description: Cloudant's clustered CouchDB
 BigCouch is Cloudant's dynamo-style clustered version of Apache CouchDB 1.1.
 Its features were merged into Apache CouchDB 2.0.
 .
 This is BigCouch 0.4.2b, built for Debian 12 and 13 with Erlang/OTP
 R16B03-1 bundled in /opt/bigcouch.
 Its configuration is in /etc/bigcouch.
